Scope of this license

It covers ONLY the code written by the ai.oli collective and published in this
repository (streetview.py, earth3d.py, earth3d_radius.js, both.py, banner.py,
builder.html, the .bat files and the documentation).

It does not cover, and cannot cover:

- The data fetched at runtime (Google Street View imagery, Google Earth meshes
  and textures). It remains the property of Google and its suppliers. This
  repository redistributes none of it.
- The third-party code fetched at runtime (see CREDITS.md), which remains
  governed by its own terms. This repository redistributes none of it.
- The "ai.oli" / "aioli-streetphere" name, logo and visual identity, over which
  no rights are granted here.
